<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26040" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διατειχ-ίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cut off and fortify by a wall,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				818
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν Ἰσθμόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lys.
					2.44
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν πόλιν ἀπὸ τῆς ἄκρας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					8.32.2
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>divide as by a wall,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ῥὶς διατετείχικε τὰ ὄμματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Smp.</u>
					5.6
				</span></i>
			: metaph., <i>keep apart,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φῶς καὶ σκότος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.632
				</span></i>
			, al.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διατετείχισται ἡ ἱστορία
				πρὸς τὸ ἐγκώμιον</span>
			<i>is separated</i> from it, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Hist.Conscr.</u>
				7
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
